msgctxt "3688"
msgid "You know, Kiryu-san, you're pretty muscular. You work out, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3700"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3712"
msgid "Are you from Tokyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3724"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3736"
msgid ""
"I knew it. I could just tell you were a Tokyoite. I've been away from Tokyo "
"for a bit myself, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3748"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3760"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3772"
msgid ""
"There are just too many people in Tokyo, you know? I was enjoying the "
"simple life out in the countryside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3784"
msgid "Tokyo can definitely be overwhelming at times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3796"
msgid "Yeah... Ever since coming back, I can't bear to get on trains."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3808"
msgid "Too many people?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3820"
msgid "Right. Packed trains just feel so claustrophobic now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3832"
msgid ""
"The countryside has spoiled me. I think I'm becoming a country girl. "
"Hahaha. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3844"
msgid ""
"There were no trains where I was staying, and even the buses only stopped "
"three times a day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3856"
msgid "You really must have been out in the boonies, then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3868"
msgid "Oh, yeah. There was practically nothing out there. Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3880"
msgid ""
"I went to the train station just the other day, but the train was so "
"packed, I couldn't stand it. I just turned around and went home..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3892"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3904"
msgid ""
"Hey, don't laugh! There were just so many people on it! Maybe I should just "
"go back to the countryside. Hehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3916"
msgid ""
"But I know that trains are, like, the best way to get around in Tokyo. If I "
"can't ride trains, I'm kinda stuck, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3928"
msgid "I was completely fine before I went to the country, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3940"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3952"
msgid "I wonder if I can ever get used to living in Tokyo again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3964"
msgid "That's going to be tough to overcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3976"
msgid "Whaaat!? So you don't have any faith in me after all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3988"
msgid "I guess I am hopeless..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4000"
msgid "I'll have to start looking at homes in the sticks, haha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4012"
msgid ""
"Well, I wouldn't go that far, but the trains are convenient. I'm sure "
"you'll be able to get used to them after a few rides."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4024"
msgid "I hope so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4036"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4048"
msgid "I'm right there with you. The trains are definitely too crowded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4060"
msgid "Oh my gosh, right? There are just way too many people!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4072"
msgid ""
"I was fine before I went out to the countryside, but now I can't stand the "
"thought of being packed shoulder to shoulder with so many people..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4084"
msgid "Now you're making me worry about it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4096"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! ♪ Well, joking about it does help me deal with it, but I can't keep "
"saying things like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4108"
msgid "One way or another, I gotta get used to riding them again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4120"
msgid "No way I can survive here without them. Hahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4132"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4144"
msgid "How about getting around by bicycle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4156"
msgid "What? By bicycle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4168"
msgid "Yeah. Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4180"
msgid "I never thought of that! Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4192"
msgid "You know, I'm a very good bicyclist!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4204"
msgid "Oh, but I have to buy a new one. I gave my old one away to a friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4216"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4228"
msgid "Well, that was before I went to the countryside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4240"
msgid "I was riding during a heavy storm. I slipped and fell pretty hard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4252"
msgid ""
"I got really frustrated after that, and I haven't wanted to ride since. "
"Heh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4264"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4276"
msgid "By the way, Kiryu-san. I want to apologize to you in advance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4288"
msgid "Why is that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4300"
msgid "It's just, a lot of people tell me I'm kind of an oddball. Hehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4312"
msgid "I'm not sure what you mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4324"
msgid ""
"I mean, it's not like I'm trying to say weird things, they just... slip "
"out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4336"
msgid "Let's see, what can I use as an example?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4348"
msgid ""
"Okay, so like, you know the stuff that you write in your graduation essay, "
"right? When they ask, like, what your treasure is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4360"
msgid "Well, I wrote down \"life.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4372"
msgid "When my friends saw that, they asked me if something was troubling me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4384"
msgid "People always thought I was a weird kid..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4396"
msgid ""
"But yeah, that's me. I just wanted to let you know I was weird before you "
"started thinking I was weird... Um... Does that make sense?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4408"
msgid "Your friends didn't get it. An answer like that is too obvious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4420"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4432"
msgid ""
"It's not what they were expecting. It's so obvious, no one would think to "
"write it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4444"
msgid "Ooh, is that why everyone was so confused!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4456"
msgid "It's a good answer, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4468"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ I wouldn't have realized that without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4480"
msgid "Thank you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4492"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4504"
msgid "That's a... unique answer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4516"
msgid "I guess it's not something most people would say, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4528"
msgid "Well, it is kind of deep, in a way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4540"
msgid "I guess so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4552"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4564"
msgid "That's not weird, that's clever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4576"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4588"
msgid "Yeah, seriously. It's a brilliant response to such an open-ended question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4600"
msgid ""
"You get it, Kiryu-san! I'm the one who's normal, and the ones saying I'm "
"weird are actually the weird ones!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4612"
msgid "No one really understands how amazing life really is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4624"
msgid "That's not... Well, sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4636"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. Well, I'm happy that someone understands me! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4648"
msgid "Happy to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4660"
msgid ""
"So you know how I mentioned I'd been away from Tokyo for a while? Maybe "
"it's because of that, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4672"
msgid "I feel like my Japanese is... off. Like, my intonation sounds weird."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4684"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4696"
msgid "Hehehe. Well, obviously, I am trying to sound normal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4708"
msgid ""
"It's just that sometimes when I talk, I feel like... I dunno... Like I "
"said, my intonation is off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4720"
msgid "And it makes me think, like, \"Huh, did I pick up an accent?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4732"
msgid ""
"Actually, I'm kind of nervous about talking at all lately. Maybe it's "
"because I'm in this line of work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4744"
msgid "What's being a hostess got to do with it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4756"
msgid ""
"I'm worried that when someone talks to me, I'll respond in an accent on "
"accident, and I'll sound like some country bumpkin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4768"
msgid "So I always hesitate before I say anything just to make sure..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4780"
msgid "Though sometimes that kind of disrupts the conversation..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4792"
msgid "You'll get back into the swing of things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4804"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4816"
msgid "But what about my fear of talking...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4828"
msgid ""
"The longer you spend in Tokyo, the more natural your speech will end up "
"sounding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4840"
msgid "You really think so? I'm worried I'll just double down on the accent..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4852"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4864"
msgid "I think accents sound cute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4876"
msgid "Hehehe. Seems to be a popular opinion. One of my friends said so too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4888"
msgid "See? I'm not the only one who thinks that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4900"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4912"
msgid ""
"Maybe you're right! I was so worried about sounding weird, but if you think "
"accents are cute, then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4924"
msgid "Maybe I don't have to get rid of it right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4936"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4948"
msgid ""
"I feel a little better about it. ♪ Mighty grateful, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4960"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4972"
msgid "You're overthinking it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4984"
msgid "*sigh* You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4996"
msgid ""
"You just came back from the countryside. Of course you're going to think "
"you stand out when everyone here is speaking without an accent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5008"
msgid ""
"You sound fine, though. To be honest, if you hadn't brought it up, I "
"wouldn't have even noticed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5020"
msgid "You know what? You're absolutely right. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5032"
msgid ""
"And I am having fun talking to you like this, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm not afraid around you, at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5044"
msgid "Heh. There's nothing to be afraid of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5056"
msgid ""
"Actually, that reminds me. The other day, something embarrassing happened "
"to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5068"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5080"
msgid "So I have a dog, right? And I took her to the pet store to get some stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5092"
msgid "You have a dog? What's its name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5104"
msgid "Oh, her name's Newton. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5116"
msgid "Newton, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5128"
msgid ""
"Sounds smart, right? Well, she doesn't quite live up to her name. Hehe. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5140"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5152"
msgid ""
"So, the lady at the register was like, \"What a cute miniature dachshund "
"you have!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5164"
msgid "And when I heard that, I was like, \"What!?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5176"
msgid "So I told her, \"I think she's a kaninchen dachshund.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5188"
msgid "And then she's like, \"She's definitely a miniature dachshund, honey.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5200"
msgid "But I was shocked, like, \"Whaaaat!?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5212"
msgid "So I asked her again, \"Are you sure she's not a kaninchen dachshund?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5224"
msgid ""
"And the lady explained it to me. \"She's a miniature. You can tell because "
"she's bigger than a kaninchen.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5236"
msgid ""
"Apparently, I was mistaken about the type of dog I owned this whole time. "
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5248"
msgid "I wonder... Am I just an irresponsible person? Hehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5260"
msgid "Are they that hard to tell apart?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5272"
msgid "I have no clue what's different about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5284"
msgid "Who cares, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5296"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. ♪ But I'm the owner. I should know my own dog better than that, "
"shouldn't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5308"
msgid "Hah. I suppose you've got a point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5320"
msgid "I wonder what Newton thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5332"
msgid "Hahaha. ♪ Well, I wonder..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5344"
msgid ""
"She was probably like, \"Whaaaaat!? I ain't no kaninchen!\"\r\n"
"Something like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5356"
msgid "Heh. Maybe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5368"
msgid "Actually..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5380"
msgid ""
"If she really thought that, then I doubt she'd ever look me in the eyes "
"again... Hehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5392"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5404"
msgid "That is embarrassing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5416"
msgid "You think so too, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5428"
msgid "Am I wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5440"
msgid "...I guess I need to start trying to remember what sort of dog I have..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5452"
msgid "I've failed as a dog owner..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5464"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5476"
msgid "The rent sure is high in Tokyo, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5488"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5500"
msgid "I know I just moved here, but I already want to move away..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5512"
msgid "You don't like where you live?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5524"
msgid "That's not quite it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5536"
msgid "There's something strange about my place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5548"
msgid "What do you mean, \"strange\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5560"
msgid "This one light socket keeps burning out the bulbs I put in it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5572"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5584"
msgid "I only moved in two months ago, but it's already burned out four bulbs..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5596"
msgid ""
"I never leave it on when I leave the room, the light bulb is the right "
"wattage, and Newton keeps barking at it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5608"
msgid "...Newton's barking at it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5620"
msgid "I'm kind of a homebody, so it really bothers me when my home isn't perfect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5632"
msgid "You should move out right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5644"
msgid "I want to, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5656"
msgid "It's not cheap, is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5668"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I'll lose my security deposit. They won't give me anything back at "
"all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5680"
msgid "That's rough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5692"
msgid "I think I'll have to just deal with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5704"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5716"
msgid "Just get a better light bulb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5728"
msgid "What, like a more expensive one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5740"
msgid "Yeah. You must be using a cheap one, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5752"
msgid "No... I've been buying them straight from an appliance store..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5764"
msgid "Maybe I can find something better there, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5776"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5788"
msgid "Time to call an exorcist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5800"
msgid "What!? An exorcist!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5812"
msgid "Yeah. Sounds like you've got a poltergeist problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5824"
msgid "Hehehe. So some naughty ghost is burning out my light?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5836"
msgid "What do you know about ghosts, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5848"
msgid "Nothing, really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5860"
msgid "Huh? So you were joking the whole time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5872"
msgid "Heh. Maybe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5884"
msgid "Oh, puh-lease. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Don't you start with that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5896"
msgid ""
"Oh, so one of the girls at the club got angry at me for eating all the "
"snacks the other day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5908"
msgid "...All of the snacks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5920"
msgid ""
"Well, the owner bought them in Ginza, and there were just enough for each "
"of us..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5932"
msgid "But then I started eating them, and I couldn't stop..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5944"
msgid ""
"And so she told me, \"You ate all the snacks again, didn't you!? What's "
"your stomach made of!?\" Hehehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5956"
msgid "Just couldn't help yourself, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5968"
msgid "I've always been like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5980"
msgid "If there's food in front of me, I'll eat every crumb even if I'm not hungry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5992"
msgid "It's just like, y'know, it'd be a waste if I just left it sitting there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6004"
msgid "And then the next thing I know, they're gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6016"
msgid ""
"You know how when you go to a drinking party, there're plates of food and "
"snacks and stuff, and it's supposed to feed the whole party?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6028"
msgid "If nobody stops me, I end up eating everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6040"
msgid "Why do you think that is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6052"
msgid "Maybe you're stressed out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6064"
msgid "Huh? Well, I am a little stressed, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6076"
msgid "If anything's troubling you, you can tell me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6088"
msgid "I suppose so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6100"
msgid ""
"Mostly I'm stressed about my weight. Do you think there's a way to eat as "
"much as you want without getting fat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6112"
msgid "...No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6124"
msgid "Maybe you just like everything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6136"
msgid "There are some things I don't like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6148"
msgid "But I'll eat anything that's put in front of me even if I don't like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6160"
msgid "You will?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6172"
msgid "Yeah. Like, when someone puts seafood in front of me, I'll eat that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6184"
msgid ""
"And then they're like, \"You just ate octopus, you know. Don't you hate "
"that?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6196"
msgid "And it's like, yeah, I know. It happens a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6208"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6220"
msgid "You've just got a black hole for a stomach. You're sure skinny enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6232"
msgid "Hehehe. I'm not that skinny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6244"
msgid "You're skinnier than you should be if you eat that much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6256"
msgid ""
"Oh, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You're just being considerate, "
"aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6268"
msgid "That's right. I consider many things about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6280"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Well, I'll let you think about me all you "
"want\r\n"
"for free. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6292"
msgid ""
"You know, thinking about it, I don't think I can handle living in Tokyo "
"after all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6304"
msgid ""
"On top of everything we talked about, there's the fact that I get lost "
"easily..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6316"
msgid ""
"Like, even when I know exactly where I have to go, I end up somewhere else "
"instead somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6328"
msgid "The city can be confusing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6340"
msgid ""
"And this city is always go, go, going twenty-four hours a day. Morning, "
"night, or whenever, people are always going somewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6352"
msgid "You can go out to eat, shop, or play at any time, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6364"
msgid "That sounds about right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6376"
msgid ""
"Out in the countryside, it was just oceans and mountains all around, and "
"you had to travel forever to get anywhere else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6388"
msgid ""
"And at night, it was so peaceful. No people, no lights. Just the darkness, "
"the wilderness, and the bugs chirping you to sleep. Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6400"
msgid "You could see so many stars, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6412"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6424"
msgid "Kiryu-san, do you know about the gejigeji centipedes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6436"
msgid "I think I do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6448"
msgid ""
"So I looked them up in a reference book. Apparently, the gejigeji are part "
"of the geji genus in the geji family..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6460"
msgid "...That's a lot of gejis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6472"
msgid ""
"It sure is! The book said they're only supposed to be about three "
"centimeters, but I swear, they were, like, ten in the countryside!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6484"
msgid "That's pretty big."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6496"
msgid "But you know, now that I'm in back in Tokyo..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6508"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't change that place for the world, even if it is a boring "
"backwater with nothing to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6520"
msgid "Some things shouldn't change. The country does have its charms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6532"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6544"
msgid "But ten centimeters... That's one big bug."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6556"
msgid "I know! It's, like, totally unbelievable, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6568"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6580"
msgid "Better watch out next time you're there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6592"
msgid "Thinking of going back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6604"
msgid ""
"Maybe? I did sort of come back to Tokyo because I got bored of the country "
"life, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6616"
msgid "But it is nice to visit those types of places every once in a while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6628"
msgid "Hehe. You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6640"
msgid "You really learn to appreciate places like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6652"
msgid "Yeah, I guess so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6664"
msgid "I'd like to go there sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6676"
msgid ""
"But if you went there, you'd totally be like, \"Oh my gosh! There's really "
"nothing here!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6688"
msgid " Maybe I would."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6700"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. It seriously looks like a village that was blasted back to the "
"feudal era."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6712"
msgid "That makes me want to go even more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6724"
msgid "Really? Well I hope you're not too shocked when you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6736"
msgid "I'm sure it'll be fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6748"
msgid ""
"So if I went with you, does that mean we'd spend our nights together, "
"Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6760"
msgid "Oh, don't mind me. I'm just fantasizing a little. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6772"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6784"
msgid "Oh, shoot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6796"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6808"
msgid "So I sent one of my pictures to my family, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6820"
msgid "And they replied, \"Did you gain weight?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6832"
msgid "Ouch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6844"
msgid "When I get stressed out, I sometimes hole myself up in my room and pig out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6856"
msgid ""
"I've been feeling so sluggish lately. Maybe I spent too much time in the "
"countryside..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6868"
msgid ""
"I really can't stand this! At this rate, I'm gonna become the country hog I "
"feel like I am!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6880"
msgid "If you're worried about it, why not go on a diet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6892"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ Kiryu-san, have you heard of the banana diet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6904"
msgid "Can't say I have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6916"
msgid "It's all about not wasting effort, not wasting money, and not wasting time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6928"
msgid "Doesn't that concept totally fit me? Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6940"
msgid "Apparently, it's getting common for dieters to eat bananas for breakfast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6952"
msgid "Bananas? Is that the whole diet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6964"
msgid ""
"Huh!? Of course not, Kiryu-san! There's no way you can get enough nutrients "
"eating just bananas!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6976"
msgid ""
"You just replace your breakfast with a banana. I usually add a glass of "
"milk to that, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6988"
msgid "Wow. And that's enough for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7000"
msgid "No! That's the problem! I can handle it when I'm home..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7012"
msgid ""
"But there's so much super tasty food around town, and it's sooo hard to "
"resist! Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7024"
msgid "Heh. It's definitely a struggle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7036"
msgid "No one succeeds on a diet like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7048"
msgid ""
"Whoa! Givin' it to me straight, huh, Kiryu-san? I didn't expect you to be "
"so direct. Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7060"
msgid ""
"It's important to have a goal, but the only thing that's going to help you "
"lose weight is hard work and perseverence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7072"
msgid "Yeah... I guess you're right. No way around that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7084"
msgid "Why do you need to go on a diet, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7096"
msgid ""
"The manager threatened to fire me if I got fat. Hostesses gotta keep their "
"figure, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7108"
msgid "You can splurge a little bit, can't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7120"
msgid ""
"Well, it's not that big a deal, I just hate having someone breathing down "
"my neck and nagging me to do stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7132"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7144"
msgid "I've never gone on a diet in my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7156"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you don't need to. You're already in great shape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7168"
msgid ""
"This isn't about me. You can't be so reckless with your eating, or your "
"body will pay the price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7180"
msgid "Oh my, are you worried about me, Kiryu-san? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7192"
msgid "...A little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7204"
msgid ""
"Hehehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You're such a sweetie, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7216"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7228"
msgid "Kiryu-san, I wanna apologize for the other day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7240"
msgid "It's fine, don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7252"
msgid " No, seriously. I'm really sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7264"
msgid "Were you not feeling yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7276"
msgid "It's not that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7288"
msgid "Hm? What, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7300"
msgid "I'm apologizing because I totally crashed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7312"
msgid "Hah hah hah hah hah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7324"
msgid "Hehehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7336"
msgid ""
"I'm such an airhead, aren't I? You went out of your way to see me, but I "
"was out like a college girl on her 20th birthday!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7348"
msgid "Except it was food that did you in, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7360"
msgid "Bingo! You read me like a book, Kiryu-san. Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7372"
msgid "Heh. Well, you've only got one vice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7384"
msgid "Guess I'll just have to punish you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7396"
msgid "Oh no! How are you going to do it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7408"
msgid "I'm joking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7420"
msgid ""
"Oh... But you know I really am an idiot, right? I do mess up a lot, after "
"all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7432"
msgid "I'm in no position to beg for forgiveness. So go on! Flick my forehead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7444"
msgid "...Flick your forehead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7456"
msgid "Yes, flick my forehead and teach me a lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7468"
msgid "You sure? I'm... pretty strong, you know. It might hurt. A lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7480"
msgid "Uh... A lot...? Maybe I can find another way to learn my lesson..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7492"
msgid "I was kidding about that, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7504"
msgid "It happens. Don't sweat it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7516"
msgid " I really am sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7528"
msgid "It's not a big deal. I can respect living life at your own pace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7540"
msgid "Really? I'm happy to hear you say that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7552"
msgid "Just be sure to rein yourself in, or you actually will get fired."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7564"
msgid "I know, I know, don't worry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7576"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7588"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7600"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7612"
msgid ""
"There's something I wanna talk to you about. It's not really something "
"you're supposed to tell people, but will you hear me out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7624"
msgid "Sure. What's on your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7636"
msgid "I don't really think there's a good way to say this, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7648"
msgid ""
"Okay, like, as an example, do you have any regrets or anything like that, "
"Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7660"
msgid "...Some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7672"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7684"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7696"
msgid "I sometimes hate myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7708"
msgid "I really get caught up thinking about my past regrets and mistakes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7720"
msgid ""
"Okay, no, it's not that I'm caught up on them. It's more, I feel like I'm "
"running away from my problems because I can't see the future..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7732"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7744"
msgid "...Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7756"
msgid "I'm sorry for bringing up something so heavy, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7768"
msgid "You're overthinking it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7780"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7792"
msgid "Yeah. Everyone has their problems and regrets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7804"
msgid ""
"But worrying about them so much is only going to paralyze you, and you'll "
"never be able to move on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7816"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7828"
msgid "Try to loosen up a little. Take your mind off it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7840"
msgid ""
"Oh... I guess I shouldn't be talking about things like this here, huh?\r\n"
"I'll stop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7852"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7864"
msgid "You're not alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7876"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7888"
msgid ""
"Really. Life gets to everyone from time to time. It's only natural for you "
"to feel that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7900"
msgid ""
"So don't feel like you have to shoulder this burden alone. We're all right "
"there with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7912"
msgid "You're right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7924"
msgid "Hehe. I'm starting to feel better already. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7936"
msgid "Glad to hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7948"
msgid "That's just life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7960"
msgid ""
"Come on, this isn't the first problem you've had, right? And it won't be "
"the last."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7972"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7984"
msgid "For better or worse, you have to forge your own path through life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7996"
msgid "...Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8008"
msgid ""
"So you're saying I can't rely on anyone else for help? Guess I shouldn't "
"have brought it up. Sorry, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8020"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8032"
msgid "I recently dug out some old pictures of Newton, and I realized something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8044"
msgid ""
"She was so cute when she was a tiny puppy, but lately, she's acting like an "
"old fart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8056"
msgid "Heh. What's she doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8068"
msgid ""
"Lately, she's just been flopping down on the floor with her belly out! "
"Like, have some decency! You're gonna catch a cold!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8080"
msgid ""
"And she just lays there even when I try to give her food. Of course, when I "
"crack open the snacks, that's when she comes running."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8092"
msgid "She's so totally faking being sick. Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8104"
msgid ""
"Should she even be doing that? Like, come on, girl! It's so unladylike! But "
"I can't stay mad at her. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8116"
msgid "She takes after her mom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8128"
msgid "What!? You mean me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8140"
msgid "Am I wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8152"
msgid "Hey, I don't fake being sick..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8164"
msgid "Oh, right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8176"
msgid "But I guess she is kind of like me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8188"
msgid ""
"She can't fake being sick to save her life... And she is kind of a terrible "
"liar..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8200"
msgid "...Huh. I guess you're right, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8212"
msgid "Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8224"
msgid "But at least she's cute, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8236"
msgid "Well, yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8248"
msgid "Kiryu-san... You seem like you don't really care about this at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8260"
msgid "Oh... Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8272"
msgid "They're always cute when they're little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8284"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ Grown-up Newton is nothing like puppy Newton, though!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8296"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'll show you the picture of Newton when she was little sometime! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Then you'll see what I mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8308"
msgid "Heh, looking forward to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8320"
msgid "I'll even bring the pictures of her being an old fart. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8332"
msgid "...Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8344"
msgid "Oh, yeah! I found some clothes that are perfect for Newton today!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8356"
msgid "Did you now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8368"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. Oh yes I did. Two cute costumes. A honeybee and a dinosaur. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8380"
msgid "I went shopping right before I came to the club today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8392"
msgid "I found a pet shop and saw the two costumes on display, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8404"
msgid ""
"And the moment I saw them, it was like, oh, em, gee. And I just had to buy "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8416"
msgid ""
"I just know they'll look adorable on Newton. ♪ I want to go home right now "
"so I can see what she looks like in them! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8428"
msgid "You have an odd fashion sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8440"
msgid "What do you mean? You don't think they'd look adorable on her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8452"
msgid "...I honestly don't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8464"
msgid ""
"Trust me, clothes that make you think, \"Wow, aren't you just an adorable "
"little dummy?\" are perfect for her. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8476"
msgid "Do you want to see pictures of her in those costumes some time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8488"
msgid "...I'll pass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8500"
msgid "So you like costumes, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8512"
msgid ""
"I love 'em! Newton's just a silly little girl, so they're perfect\r\n"
"for her. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8524"
msgid ""
"Although she'll probably be like, \"Why are you doing this to me?\" when I "
"put her in the honeybee costume. Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8536"
msgid "You should try wearing a matching honeybee suit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8548"
msgid "Ooh, good idea, Kiryu-san! That sounds fun! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8560"
msgid "We'll get you one, too, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8572"
msgid ""
"I'd love to put you in a honeybee suit and make you walk with me and "
"Newton. I can just imagine your face, like, \"Why are you doing this to "
"me?\" <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8584"
msgid "Hehehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8596"
msgid "Yeah, that'd probably be my reaction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8608"
msgid "Don't you feel bad for making her wear those?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8620"
msgid "Yeah, kinda. In all actuality... She probably hates them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8632"
msgid "She especially doesn't like clothes that cover her bottom..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8644"
msgid "You should give her a break from all this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8656"
msgid "Maybe you're right... But she's so adorable when she wears those costumes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8668"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8680"
msgid "Kiryu-san, do you do any martial arts?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8692"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8704"
msgid "It's just, I noticed how muscular you are. You're pretty built, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8716"
msgid "It just made sense that you'd do some kind of martial art or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8728"
msgid "Being a guy must be great..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8740"
msgid "When I was little, I wanted to learn karate!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8752"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8764"
msgid ""
"But... when I told my mother that, she said that girls shouldn't be doing "
"karate..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8776"
msgid ""
"I learned swimming, calligraphy, and how to use an abacus.\r\n"
"Hehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8788"
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8800"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8812"
msgid "One of those things I just mentioned, I quit after one day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8824"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ Can you guess which it was, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8836"
msgid "Was it swimming?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8848"
msgid "Wow! Good guess! Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8860"
msgid "Kindergarten was when I first tried it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8872"
msgid ""
"But I got lost looking for the women's changing room, and I accidentally "
"opened the door to the men's changing room! It was so embarrassing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8884"
msgid "By the time I made it to the pool, everyone else had already gotten in..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8896"
msgid "I totally panicked and thought I was so, so late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8908"
msgid ""
"I quickly ran and jumped into the pool, but my feet never touched the "
"bottom, and I really thought I was gonna drown there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8920"
msgid "And that's the day I totally lost my motivation to do swimming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8932"
msgid "Heh. That'd do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8944"
msgid "Was it calligraphy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8956"
msgid "Nope! Wrong, hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8968"
msgid "I worked pretty hard on calligraphy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8980"
msgid "Er, but I actually forgot how long I did that for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8992"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9004"
msgid "Was it using the abacus?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9016"
msgid "Bzzz! Wrong answer, hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9028"
msgid "I was pretty good at the abacus back then, actually!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9040"
msgid ""
"But there is absolutely no way I'd be able to work one now. I wouldn't be "
"able to flick the beads with these nails."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9052"
msgid "Yeah, looks like it wouldn't be easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9064"
msgid "So I've been on this banana diet, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9076"
msgid "I think I remember you talking about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9088"
msgid "Well, my dog Newton has recently started eating bananas, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9100"
msgid ""
"When I wake up and eat a banana, I always ask her, \"Do you wanna diet with "
"me?\" and show her the banana."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9112"
msgid ""
"She would usually sniff the banana, and then give me a look like she was "
"grossed out. But now she's started to sniff for it on her own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9124"
msgid "And yesterday, she finally took a bite of one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9136"
msgid ""
"And I was like, \"Whaaaaat!? You can eat bananas?\" She was still eating it "
"pretty cautiously, though. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9148"
msgid "Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9160"
msgid "She's an odd dog for eating bananas, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9172"
msgid "It's definitely out of the ordinary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9184"
msgid "Hehe, yeah. ♪ She's a weird one, but I love her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9196"
msgid "Heh. Nothing wrong with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9208"
msgid "I wonder if Newton wants to diet, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9220"
msgid "Maybe she just wants to eat what you eat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9232"
msgid "Hmm, maybe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9244"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9256"
msgid "Is it okay for her to eat that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9268"
msgid "Hmm... I'm not sure... Actually, now I'm starting to get worried..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9280"
msgid "It might be good to look into that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9292"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you're right. I'll see what I can find about it. They can't eat "
"chocolate, either, if I remember right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9304"
msgid ""
"I can't be doing something that might be dangerous for her just because I "
"find it funny..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9316"
msgid "Yeah. Just be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9328"
msgid "I'm not sure she thinks of herself as a dog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9340"
msgid "I think you're right! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9352"
msgid "Maybe she thinks she's a person like me, or maybe something else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9364"
msgid "Either way, Newton must live a happy life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9376"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I certainly hope so!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9388"
msgid "I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9400"
msgid ""
"Okay, so this is an odd topic, but noticed that whenever I'm troubled, I "
"tend to talk more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9412"
msgid "What can I use as an example...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9424"
msgid ""
"Oh, okay, so when I'm with a quieter customer, right? I get flustered "
"trying to think of things to say to fill the void, and I go all over the "
"place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9436"
msgid ""
"I just blurt out whatever comes to mind, like, \"How was your day?\" or "
"\"It's cold out, huh?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9448"
msgid ""
"Maybe the silence just makes me nervous, but when my customer is quiet, I "
"feel like I need to keep talking and talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9460"
msgid "That's why I enjoy talking to you the most, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9472"
msgid ""
"I don't feel like I'm forcing myself to talk, and there's no dead time "
"where neither of us is talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9484"
msgid "I feel the same way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9496"
msgid "You do, Kiryu-san? You really like talking to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9508"
msgid "Yeah. I like it when you're more relaxed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9520"
msgid ""
"Hearing that makes me feel all warm and tingly inside. ♪\r\n"
"...And a little embarrassed. Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9532"
msgid "Isn't talking your job, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9544"
msgid "What!? Hey, Kiryu-san, cut it out! Are you trying to make me more stressed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9556"
msgid "Heh... I was just kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9568"
msgid "Yeah, well... I know I still need work on being a hostess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9580"
msgid "If there's something you don't like about me, please just say so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9592"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9604"
msgid "So talking to me is just business, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9616"
msgid "Business...? Wait, what!? No way, Kiryu-san! That's not it at all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9628"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9640"
msgid "I just wanted to tell you how I felt, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9652"
msgid "I can't believe you'd say something like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9664"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9676"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9688"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9700"
msgid ""
"Nothing... It's just... I lost my wallet when I went out with my dad on "
"Sunday..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9712"
msgid ""
"We went out on a little road trip, and while we were out, we stopped at a "
"rest area to get something to eat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9724"
msgid ""
"What were those things they had...? Oh, right! The instant ramen vending "
"machines! They even pour hot water for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9736"
msgid ""
"So I figured, you know, my dad deserves a treat sometimes, and I bought two "
"bowls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9748"
msgid "Of course, then I had two heaping handfuls of noodle bowls, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9760"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9772"
msgid ""
"I realized later that I'd left my wallet on a table near the vending "
"machine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9784"
msgid "Ah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9796"
msgid ""
"I went back after we finished eating, but no luck. Someone had taken it, I "
"guess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9808"
msgid "That was a silly thing to do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9820"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I know. I'm really disappointed in myself. I always, always mess up "
"if I'm not being careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9832"
msgid ""
"*sigh* I'm just... such an idiot! I'm an idiot, aren't I? And it was right "
"after payday, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9844"
msgid ""
"Ugh, sorry... I know I shouldn't be talking to you about this. I don't want "
"to ruin your good time at the club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9856"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9868"
msgid "That's a pretty funny story."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9880"
msgid "Hehe. ♪ I am kind of a dummy, aren't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9892"
msgid ""
"All my cards and my license were in there, too! That's the worst thing "
"about all this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9904"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9916"
msgid ""
"Oh, that reminds me! Last year, at around the same time, a thief broke into "
"my place and stole my wallet, my digital camera, and my phone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9928"
msgid "And the year before that, I dropped my wallet in the river."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9940"
msgid ""
"Better to lose your possessions than your life. Those things can easily be "
"replaced, but you're irreplaceable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9952"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. ♪ You're a pretty smooth talker, Kiryu-san. I guess you're right, "
"though. I've got a lot to learn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9964"
msgid ""
"But I'm gonna make sure I don't lose anything else, ever, for the rest of "
"my life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9976"
msgid ""
"It's been three years in a row, so there can't be a fourth, right? And if "
"there was, I'd just laugh it off again! ♪ Ahahaha! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9988"
msgid "Well, at least you've got a good attitude about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10000"
msgid "You need to learn to be more careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10012"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you're right. I need to be more careful doing things I'm not used to "
"so I don't screw something up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10024"
msgid "Speaking of which, you should be more careful as well, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10036"
msgid "Uh... All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10048"
msgid "I really feel for you there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10060"
msgid ""
"I appreciate that, Kiryu-san. I had just gotten paid, so I lost that as "
"well as all the cards that were in there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10072"
msgid "That's really rough..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10084"
msgid "I guess there's nothing to do but start saving up again, huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10096"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10108"
msgid "I've been getting a lot of barkers calling out to me on the street lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10120"
msgid "Not that I even give them the time of day, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10132"
msgid ""
"But obviously, they just yell at me more and tell me to stop ignoring "
"them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10144"
msgid "And that just makes me feel bad for doing it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10156"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10168"
msgid "And the newbie barkers are just the worst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10180"
msgid ""
"They don't just shout at you, they always open with something like, "
"\"Excuse me, I'm looking for something...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10192"
msgid ""
"They act all innocent and helpless, right? So I ask them what they're "
"looking for, because of course I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10204"
msgid ""
"And then they say something super cheesy, like, \"I lost a piece of my "
"heart.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10216"
msgid "Heh. That's beyond cheesy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10228"
msgid ""
"It's creepy is what it is. I guess I could try to laugh it off, but that "
"wouldn't make me feel less creeped out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10240"
msgid ""
"So I get as serious as I can and tell him, \"Maybe you should go look for "
"it at the bottom of a lake?\" and run off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10252"
msgid "That's brutal..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10264"
msgid "Anyway, any suggestions for how to get barkers to leave me alone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10276"
msgid "I'm kind of at the end of my rope with them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10288"
msgid "Try scowling, and walk like you're busy and have somewhere to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10300"
msgid "But that's, like, what everyone does. They'd see right through it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10312"
msgid "Yeah, true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10324"
msgid ""
"It kind of sounds like a pain, but I'll give it a try at least. Thanks, "
"Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10336"
msgid "What about pretending to be on the phone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10348"
msgid "That's a thought! Sounds like it might even work!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10360"
msgid ""
"It certainly is harder to get people's attention when they're on their "
"phone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10372"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10384"
msgid "Except... There's one problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10396"
msgid ""
"It'd be super embarrassing if I actually got a phone call while pretending "
"to be on the phone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10408"
msgid "Oh. Good point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10420"
msgid "Maybe try dressing like a man and taking long strides?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10432"
msgid "Huh!? Dress like a man...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10444"
msgid "Yeah. Walk like one, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10456"
msgid "...I guess that would make me unattractive to barkers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10468"
msgid ""
"But not just barkers, right? Wouldn't people say things like, \"Look at "
"that creepy guy over there!\" or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10480"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10492"
msgid "I did it again... I'm really sorry, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10504"
msgid "Heh, don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10516"
msgid "I know you went out of your way to see me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10528"
msgid "Missing work two times in a row, I'm a terrible hostess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10540"
msgid " I really am sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10552"
msgid "Was it an emergency?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10564"
msgid "...No, anything but."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10576"
msgid "What, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10588"
msgid "I just... passed out again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10600"
msgid "Heh. You're a funny one, Kana."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10612"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10624"
msgid "You really like overeating until you pass out, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10636"
msgid "Hehehe. I sure do! I like seeing how long I can stay passed out, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10648"
msgid "But seriously..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10660"
msgid "It is a problem I have to deal with..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10672"
msgid "I don't want to keep disappointing you, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10684"
msgid "It's fine. Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10696"
msgid "Now I really have to punish you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10708"
msgid "Yes, please! Flick my forehead really hard this time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10720"
msgid "Flick your forehead...? You sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10732"
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10792"
msgid "...Ow. That really, super stings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10804"
msgid "Did I flick you too hard?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10816"
msgid "I mean, it is what I deserve..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10828"
msgid "So I'm completely okay with it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10840"
msgid "And... I'll apologize as many times as I need to, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10852"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10864"
msgid "Don't you have an alarm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10876"
msgid "I do! I have two, but they still don't help me wake up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10888"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10900"
msgid "I even bought this ginormous one, but it's not enough..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10912"
msgid "...Ah, I know what I have to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10924"
msgid ""
"I'll just have to buy a third one! Let's go buy a new alarm clock, "
"Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10936"
msgid ""
"Aw, who am I kidding? If two aren't doing anything, what good would a third "
"be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10948"
msgid "Not much..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10960"
msgid ""
"Ooh, you know what would work? If you gave me a wakeup call every morning, "
"Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10972"
msgid "...Kana, I'm not responsible for waking you up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10984"
msgid "So the other day, I was asking for directions from the police."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10996"
msgid ""
"And while I was, this old lady came up and said she'd just got mugged, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11008"
msgid "The officer kept asking questions like when, where, what and all that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11020"
msgid "But the old lady couldn't really remember and was kind of panicking..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11032"
msgid "So the officer said she should come back when she could remember..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11044"
msgid "So the old lady started crying!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11056"
msgid "That's terrible..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11068"
msgid ""
"The police are just the worst! That officer should have been more "
"understanding to the poor old lady!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11080"
msgid ""
"I mean, they have a sign that specifically says to watch out for muggings, "
"but that doesn't mean they can just sit around when it does happen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11092"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11104"
msgid ""
"I guess there really isn't any justice in the world, Kiryu-san. Everyone "
"and everything is just... fake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11116"
msgid "The world can seem pretty rotten sometimes, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11128"
msgid "You think so, too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11140"
msgid "Well, I am tempted to feel that way at times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11152"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11164"
msgid ""
"I criticized that cop, but I couldn't do anything to help the old lady "
"either...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11176"
msgid "In the end, I'm just as fake as everyone else..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11188"
msgid "Is life even worth living? I'm really starting to hate myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11200"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11212"
msgid "There is still good in the world, Kana. It's not all fake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11224"
msgid ""
"It's not? There are things out there that aren't just made of pretty lies? "
"There are genuine people?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11236"
msgid "Of course there are genuine people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11248"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11260"
msgid "I'm talking to one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11272"
msgid "...No, Kiryu-san, I'm not genuine at all... I'm just a dumb, lazy girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11284"
msgid "That doesn't make you fake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11296"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, you're a fully fledged adult... so you're able to think of "
"things that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11308"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11320"
msgid ""
"I criticized that cop, but I couldn't do anything to help the old lady "
"either...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11332"
msgid "In the end, I'm just as fake as everyone else..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11344"
msgid "You aren't. Take some time to calm down and think it over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11356"
msgid "...All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11368"
msgid ""
"Thanks, Kiryu-san. I do feel a little better after talking to you. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11380"
msgid "Happy to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11392"
msgid "You always know just what to say. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11404"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Listen to this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11416"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11428"
msgid "So last night, I had this suuuper weird dream!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11440"
msgid "In the dream, I had to get up and use the bathroom, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11452"
msgid "I got to the bathroom, and everything was normal so far, when..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11464"
msgid ""
"Newton, like, slams open the door, and I swear she totally clicked her "
"tongue at me like she was really angry with me about something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11476"
msgid "And then I realize that Newton's legs are way longer than they should be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11488"
msgid "And it was like, what the heck!? That's extra creepy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11500"
msgid "A short-legged dog suddenly getting long legs? That's wild, right? Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11512"
msgid "Heh... That's a weird one all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11524"
msgid ""
"I know! You think it means something? Maybe Newton was trying to send me a "
"message!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11536"
msgid ""
"A lot of good things happened today, so maybe Newton was just trying to "
"tell me I was gonna have a good day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11548"
msgid "Sounds like it was a good dream, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11560"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11572"
msgid "You had a good day afterward, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11584"
msgid "I sure did! ♪ I ended up getting some snacks from a customer. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11596"
msgid ""
"It was a weird dream, but I liked it. And it was so funny when Newton "
"clicked her tongue at me! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11608"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11620"
msgid ""
"She's a good girl. I'll feed her a banana when I get home.\r\n"
"Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11632"
msgid "Dreams don't mean anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11644"
msgid "Ahaha! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11656"
msgid ""
"You're right. It was nothing but a weird dream. It was so funny when Newton "
"clicked her tongue at me, though!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11668"
msgid ""
"But still, Newton's legs were extra long. It was the most bizarre thing in "
"the world! Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11680"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11692"
msgid "It was a good omen after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11704"
msgid "Exactly! See? I knew you'd agree with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11716"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11728"
msgid "She's totally the type to just click her tongue at me for no reason."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11740"
msgid ""
"But still, when she walked in with super long legs, it was like, \"Newton, "
"what the heck!?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11752"
msgid "I hope she's okay, though. I'm starting to get worried now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11764"
msgid "I'm sure she's fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11776"
msgid "Do you prefer eating at home or going out, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11788"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11800"
msgid "Me, I like to eat at home more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11812"
msgid "Do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11824"
msgid "Yeah. Why do you think that is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11836"
msgid "Is it because you like cooking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11848"
msgid "Hehe, nope!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11860"
msgid "Why, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11872"
msgid "I'm not really a good cook, so I don't really cook when I'm at home anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11884"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11896"
msgid "Hehe. Do you like women who are good cooks, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11908"
msgid "I guess I do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11920"
msgid "Really? I guess cooking is a pretty important life skill after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11932"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11944"
msgid "Is it because you're a shut-in?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11956"
msgid "No way, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11968"
msgid ""
"I mean, okay, I do like staying inside, and I do like to shut myself off "
"from the world sometimes, but that's not it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11980"
msgid ""
"...And anyway, if I was a true shut-in, I wouldn't be working at a place "
"like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11992"
msgid "That's true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12004"
msgid "Come on, Kiryu-san. I thought I was supposed to be the dummy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12016"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12028"
msgid "Going out takes too long, I'm guessing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12040"
msgid "Wow! Yeah, that's right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12052"
msgid "When I want to go out, it usually takes me about an hour to get ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12064"
msgid ""
"But by the time I'm done with all that, I'm already exhausted.\r\n"
"Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12076"
msgid ""
"It also takes at least an hour to go to the restaurant, eat, and come back. "
"It shouldn't be such a struggle just to eat food..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12088"
msgid ""
"At home, I can eat without having to put on any makeup or wear anything "
"fancy. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12100"
msgid "...Or you could just not wear makeup, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12112"
msgid "I mean, I guess... But like, for example..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12124"
msgid ""
"If I go out without makeup, and I see some girl who's all done up to be "
"cute..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12136"
msgid "I get really jealous and super regret not doing my own makeup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12148"
msgid "Being a woman sounds tough..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12160"
msgid "Kiryu-san, there's something that's been bothering me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12172"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12184"
msgid ""
"So, one of my customers gave me a present the other day, which was nice and "
"all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12196"
msgid "But see, here's the problem!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12208"
msgid ""
"It was something super expensive! He said it cost him hundreds of thousands "
"of yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12220"
msgid "When he told me that, I was stunned. I just, like, shut down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12232"
msgid "I couldn't smile or anything, and I think that made the customer feel bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12244"
msgid "I see the problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12256"
msgid "Kiryu-san, what do you think I should do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12268"
msgid "Just take it, and thank him sincerely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12280"
msgid "You think I should?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12292"
msgid "It's a present after all, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12304"
msgid "But still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12316"
msgid "I don't think I can take it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12328"
msgid "It's way too expensive for me to accept..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12340"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12352"
msgid "Sounds like a tough situation to be in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12364"
msgid "...Yeah, it really is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12376"
msgid ""
"I'd never get over it if I let myself take something like that. I'd be in "
"debt to him for, like, ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12388"
msgid "I can't take such an expensive gift so easily. Maybe I should return it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12400"
msgid "I think that's a good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12412"
msgid "You have to return it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12424"
msgid "Yeah, for sure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12436"
msgid ""
"I'd never get over it if I let myself take something like that. I'd be in "
"debt to him for, like, ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12448"
msgid ""
"I can't take such an expensive gift so easily. I think you're right. I "
"gotta return it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12460"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12472"
msgid "Hmhmhm. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12484"
msgid ""
"But, you know, if you were the one giving me something like that, I don't "
"think I'd mind accepting it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12496"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12508"
msgid "Oh my gosh, I can't believe I just said that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12520"
msgid "That wasn't me trying to ask for presents, Kiryu-san! Just ignore me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12532"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12544"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12556"
msgid "Huh? What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12568"
msgid "No, it's nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12580"
msgid "Whaaat!? What were you gonna say? Tell me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12592"
msgid "...Okay. Get ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12604"
msgid "Yesss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12616"
msgid "Are you... in a relationship?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12628"
msgid "Whoa! What are you saying, Kiryu-san? Do you really have to ask that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12640"
msgid "Well, we haven't talked about it before..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12652"
msgid ""
"Wow, I think you're right! We only ever talk about food or Newton, huh? "
"Hehe. Yep, sounds like me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12664"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12676"
msgid "Anyway..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12688"
msgid ""
"Being with someone you love is kinda... Well, that's what they mean by "
"being \"tied down,\" you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12700"
msgid ""
"So I worry about what I'm saying to them, whether it's okay to say certain "
"things or if they agree with me and stuff..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12712"
msgid "And I guess that's just... kind of exhausting, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12724"
msgid ""
"I guess what I'm saying is that I'd want someone who doesn't make me feel "
"like that. You know what I mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12736"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12748"
msgid ""
"Hehe. I figured you might. ♪ But I've never been able to meet a person like "
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12760"
msgid "I'm sure you'll find someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12772"
msgid "Hehehe. I hope you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12784"
msgid ""
"But I do know I'm not a very good person. Plus, I hate myself for not "
"having confidence, and that just makes me hate myself more..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12796"
msgid "You're too hard on yourself. I think you're a great woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12808"
msgid "Oh, stop it, Kiryu-san. You're making me blush. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12820"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12832"
msgid "I know exactly what you mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12844"
msgid "Do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12856"
msgid "More or less..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12868"
msgid "Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12880"
msgid "You want a guy you can relax around, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12892"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12904"
msgid "Yeah, more or less. Hehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12916"
msgid "...Well, I'm sure he's out there. Keep looking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12928"
msgid "I really hope I find him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12940"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12952"
msgid "You already met him. He's right in front of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12964"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12976"
msgid "Me, Kana."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12988"
msgid "Whoa, hold on, Kiryu-san. This is way too sudden..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13000"
msgid "You're not interested in me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13012"
msgid "It's not that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13024"
msgid "What, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13036"
msgid ""
"You can't just say something like that out of the blue! I'm not ready to "
"hear that...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13048"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13060"
msgid "By the way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13072"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13084"
msgid ""
"Did you decide on whether or not you wanted to become a model for that "
"fashion magazine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13096"
msgid "Oh, that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13108"
msgid "I still can't decide..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13120"
msgid "It's not an easy decision, is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13132"
msgid "Mm... I just don't think I'm good enough right now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13144"
msgid "That's a shame."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13156"
msgid "I guess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13168"
msgid "I would have liked to see you in a magazine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13180"
msgid "Really? You would? Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13192"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13204"
msgid ""
"I dunno, Kiryu-san. The thought of you reading a fashion magazine is kinda "
"funny. Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13216"
msgid "You think so...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13228"
msgid "You still can't decide?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13240"
msgid "Nope..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13252"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13264"
msgid "I mean... To be honest, I do still kind of want to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13276"
msgid "I guess I'm just running away from it or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13288"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13300"
msgid "Think on it. You still have time to decide, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13312"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13324"
msgid "...You're right. It's not like I have to give them my decision right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13336"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13348"
msgid "Either way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13360"
msgid "It's nice to know you were worried about me, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13372"
msgid "...Why wouldn't I be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13384"
msgid "Kiryu-san, I need advice. One of my friends is in deep trouble with debt..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13396"
msgid "That's not good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13408"
msgid "I tried to talk to her about it, but she's just not listening..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13420"
msgid ""
"I tried to persuade her to try to pay it off as soon as possible, but she "
"just isn't getting it... It's so exhausting..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13432"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13444"
msgid "Talking to people is just so hard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13456"
msgid ""
"When I look at someone's face, I start getting nervous, and the expectation "
"to talk is like... Ugh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13468"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13480"
msgid ""
"I guess in the end, the only one I'll ever be comfortable around is "
"Newton..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13492"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, I'm sorry. I know I'm supposed to entertain you here, and I do "
"my best, but I'm always..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13504"
msgid "You're doing great, Kana. I do enjoy talking with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13516"
msgid "...You do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13528"
msgid ""
"I don't mind difficult topics. In the end, I still get to talk to you, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13540"
msgid "Hehehe. You really do listen to me, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13552"
msgid "Maybe that's why I always want to talk to you about these things..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13564"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13576"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13588"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I shouldn't be talking about this. You came here just to see me. I "
"don't want to bother you with this stuff..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13600"
msgid "I'm really sorry, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13612"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13624"
msgid "But I am always grateful to you for putting up with me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13636"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13648"
msgid "Cheer up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13660"
msgid "...Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13672"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13684"
msgid ""
"You know, someone telling me to cheer up doesn't really make me want to "
"cheer up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13696"
msgid "I guess I just don't have any confidence in myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13708"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13720"
msgid "Okay, there is seriously something going on with my dreams!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13732"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13744"
msgid "I had another dream about Newton last night!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13756"
msgid "Was it the same one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13768"
msgid ""
"No. Okay, so when I got home, I could hear her doing her usual \"Yay, "
"Mommy's home!\" freak-out on the other side of the door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13780"
msgid ""
"So I decided to tease her by waiting outside a little. Then suddenly, the "
"sounds just stopped."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13792"
msgid ""
"I got really worried, so I opened the door, and she's not even there. But "
"then I see the futon's kind of moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13804"
msgid "I figured it was Newton in the futon, so I yanked the cover off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13816"
msgid ""
"And she was in there all right, but she had no hair! She was smooth and "
"hairless as a baby!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13828"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13840"
msgid "And it was totally like, oh, em, gee."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13852"
msgid ""
"And obviously, if she has no hair, it makes sense that she's gonna get "
"chilly. I felt bad for her and picked her up. That's when I woke up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13864"
msgid "And what do I find when I wake up? Newton snoring on top of me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13876"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13888"
msgid "So what do you think? Is that one a bad omen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13900"
msgid "Maybe the hairless part is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13912"
msgid ""
"Well, it might be okay if it was summer. Being hairless would help her cool "
"down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13924"
msgid ""
"But still, it was a little creepy to see her without hair. ♪\r\n"
"Wait, that's not the issue here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13936"
msgid "It's probably nothing to worry about anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13948"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13960"
msgid "Yeah. It's just a dream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13972"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you're right. I feel better after talking about it. Thanks, "
"Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13984"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13996"
msgid "How am I supposed to know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14008"
msgid ""
"I guess you're right. There isn't really a way to know if it means "
"anything, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14020"
msgid ""
"Why would I even have a dream like this, though? I'm getting kind of "
"worried..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14032"
msgid "Oh, wait, I know! It's probably because I gave her too many bananas!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14044"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14056"
msgid "Maybe she's trying to tell you something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14068"
msgid "Huh!? Newton is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14080"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14092"
msgid ""
"But what is it she's trying to tell me? Is something terrible about to "
"happen? Or maybe she's upset with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14104"
msgid "That, I don't know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14116"
msgid ""
"Wait, I know! She's trying to tell me she doesn't want to be like a banana "
"without its peel!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14128"
msgid ""
"Maybe feeding her bananas is too weird after all... I guess I should stop, "
"huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14140"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14152"
msgid "I really messed up, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14164"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14176"
msgid ""
"I couldn't help myself, Kiryu-san... I ate dinner. I ate, like... three "
"dinners..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14188"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14200"
msgid ""
"I met up with a co-worker from an old job, and we hadn't seen each other in "
"forever. She said my face looked thinner, like I had lost weight..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14212"
msgid " So I got really excited. I mean, of course, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14224"
msgid ""
"Next thing I know, I'm at a yakiniku place grilling up a mountain of fatty "
"meat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14236"
msgid ""
"My thought was, \"Well, my stomach must have gotten smaller, so I can't eat "
"as much, right?\" Nope. Wrong. That thought? <Italic>Such</Italic> a "
"mistake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14248"
msgid "'Cause I ended up eating like three dinners worth of yakiniku."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14260"
msgid "Aaargh! I'm such a garbage person!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14272"
msgid "And I was doing so well on my diet, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14284"
msgid "You ate three whole helpings?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14296"
msgid "Hehe! Yep! Every scrap!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14308"
msgid ""
"It was a grim reminder that humans' stomachs are truly bottomless... Or... "
"maybe just mine is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14320"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14332"
msgid "I can't believe myself... I should have stopped at the first helping..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14344"
msgid "...Or maybe I should have not even eaten yakiniku in the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14356"
msgid "Just start your diet over from the beginning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14368"
msgid "I was actually losing weight..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14380"
msgid "But now, it's like... Darn it, Kana! *sigh*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14392"
msgid "I need to get back to eating bananas! I'm so sick of them, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14404"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14416"
msgid "Drown your sorrows in alcohol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14428"
msgid "That's starting to sound attractive..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14440"
msgid ""
"But isn't alcohol supposed to be empty calories or whatever? I don't need "
"to gain even more weight..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14452"
msgid "Oh, right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14464"
msgid ""
"Then again, I already gained weight from eating. That makes it okay, right? "
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14476"
msgid "It's okay to treat yourself sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14488"
msgid ""
"You know, if there's one thing I look forward to every year, it's the "
"fireworks show in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14500"
msgid ""
"I kind of don't like the big booms, but the beautiful fireworks more than "
"make up for it. I always get lost in their colors and lose track of time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14512"
msgid "That's poetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14524"
msgid ""
"There's just something about watching the fireworks explode in the sky one "
"after another. It's just like... Wow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14536"
msgid "I think I heard they shoot up like thousands of them. It's really amazing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14548"
msgid "And you know what the best part is? We've got premium seats for the show. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14560"
msgid "The fireworks are right by the apartment my grandparents live in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14572"
msgid "We just line up a bunch of chairs on the balcony, and tada! Box seats!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14584"
msgid ""
"And so we just watch the fireworks together, enjoying the show and each "
"other's company. And some drinks, of course. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14596"
msgid "That sounds nice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14608"
msgid ""
"I'm sure Newton would absolutely freak at the sound, though.\r\n"
"She may be a dog, but she sure is a scaredy-cat sometimes!\r\n"
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14620"
msgid ""
"I know you'd love watching the show in those special seats, Kiryu-san. The "
"view might even melt your heart a little. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14632"
msgid "In that case..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14644"
msgid "Let me come next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14656"
msgid "Huh!? Seriously?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14668"
msgid "Yeah. Invite me when the fireworks come around again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14680"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14692"
msgid ""
"Then there'll be a seat for you there! You're always more than welcome! "
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14704"
msgid "I'll look forward to it, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14716"
msgid "Sounds like it'd be crowded..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14728"
msgid "Crowded...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14740"
msgid "Yeah, I guess so. It's pretty amazing, actually!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14752"
msgid ""
"It makes sense, though. The places with good views of fireworks are always "
"crowded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14764"
msgid ""
"I think I heard thousands of people gather there, or something like that. "
"But we always watch from the apartment's balcony, so we can skip the crowd."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14776"
msgid "Hey, that's smart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14788"
msgid "I'd love to see it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14800"
msgid ""
"You really should come! It's so beautiful, I promise you'll never forget it "
"as long as you live! Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14812"
msgid "I can only imagine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14824"
msgid "And if you'd like, we can..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14836"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14848"
msgid "Oh, nothing. Don't mind me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14860"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14872"
msgid ""
"So remember I mentioned that friend of mine who was in debt? Well, she was "
"able to get her parents to help shoulder it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14884"
msgid "You seem happy about that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14896"
msgid ""
"It's good! Though in return, she has to go back home and work off what her "
"parents paid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14908"
msgid "That's reasonable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14920"
msgid ""
"Last time I saw her, we fought and stopped talking to each other. She "
"recently contacted me and said she wanted to apologize before leaving, "
"though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14932"
msgid ""
"\"I always thought of myself as your friend, but maybe I wasn't really "
"listening to what you kept saying...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14944"
msgid ""
"\"I wasn't a good friend, though. I only talked about myself and complained "
"about stuff. I hurt you, and I hurt our relationship. Sorry, Kana.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14956"
msgid ""
"Must have been hard for her to say all that... And for you to memorize it "
"verbatim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14968"
msgid ""
"I'm a really timid person, so when someone starts talking like that, all I "
"think about is what I might have done to hurt them, even if they're the one "
"at fault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14980"
msgid "But honestly, this time I was just relieved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14992"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15004"
msgid "There's a lot I've been worried about lately..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15016"
msgid ""
"But I know I shouldn't stress about stuff so much. Not like I can change "
"who I am, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15028"
msgid "I should stop lying to myself about my own feelings, at least. Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15040"
msgid "That would be a good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15052"
msgid ""
"But I am improving! I'm recognizing my failures and trying to turn myself "
"around! That's good, right? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15064"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15076"
msgid "Anyway, I'm happy you came to see me! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15088"
msgid "Hey, I'm happy to be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15100"
msgid "Kiryu-san. It's been a while, hasn't it? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15112"
msgid "A bit. How's Newton been?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15124"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ She's been great! And she's still eating bananas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15136"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15148"
msgid "Oh! So I finally decided."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15160"
msgid "I'm going to try being a model for that magazine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15172"
msgid "Do you think I can do it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15184"
msgid "Only if you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15196"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I knew you'd say something like that, "
"Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15208"
msgid "Then I guess we got to know each other pretty well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15220"
msgid "...Thank you, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15232"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15244"
msgid "Normal Conversation 30"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15256"
msgid "Normal Conversation 31"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15280"
msgid "Nice to meet you. I'm Kana Momonogi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15316"
msgid "Oh, welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15328"
msgid "Thank you for going out of your way to see me! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15340"
msgid "I'm so looking forward to this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15352"
msgid "Kiryu-san, thank you for last time. I'm sorry for being a nuisance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15364"
msgid "Kiryu-san... I know you were waiting for our date..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15376"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry about last time, Kiryu-san. I'll make it up to you next time, "
"okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15388"
msgid "Kiryu-san... I was really looking forward to accompanying you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15400"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry about last time, Kiryu-san. I'll make it up to you next time, "
"okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15412"
msgid "It's always nice to meet someone new. Hope you'll like me after today..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15424"
msgid "I'm sure I will, once I get to know you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15436"
msgid "You're back again, are you? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15448"
msgid "Please relax and make yourself at home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15460"
msgid "Please enjoy! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15472"
msgid "Please relax and make yourself at home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15484"
msgid "Thank you, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15496"
msgid "Let's go on another after-hours date sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15508"
msgid "Let's go on another after-hours date sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15520"
msgid "That after-hours date was a blast! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15532"
msgid "Will you take me out on another sometime?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15544"
msgid "Will you take me out on another sometime?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15556"
msgid "You look so suave today, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15568"
msgid "Well, Kiryu-san, aren't you looking fashionable today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15580"
msgid "You never change, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15592"
msgid "You're not looking quite as cool as usual today, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15604"
msgid "Kiryu-san... You're... looking pretty scruffy today..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15616"
msgid "You should try to make yourself look a little more presentable..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15628"
msgid "Huh! For real!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15640"
msgid "I've so been trying to get one of these... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15652"
msgid "Thank you so much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15664"
msgid "You're seriously letting me have this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15676"
msgid "Thank you so much. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15688"
msgid "I can have this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15700"
msgid "Thank you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15712"
msgid "What is that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15724"
msgid "That's a little... um... odd."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15736"
msgid "What is that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15748"
msgid "I kinda hate this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15760"
msgid "You already gave me one of these..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15772"
msgid "You don't remember...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15784"
msgid "What would you like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15808"
msgid "I'll have this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15820"
msgid "Huh? You don't want anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15832"
msgid "Did you want to order another drink?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15856"
msgid "I'll have this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15868"
msgid "Huh? You don't want any more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15880"
msgid "Hey, I love that one, too! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15892"
msgid "Can I drink it with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15904"
msgid "Okay! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15916"
msgid "Let's keep drinking! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15928"
msgid "Okay, got it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15940"
msgid " You're ordering that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15952"
msgid "Well, that's fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15964"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15976"
msgid "I was hoping you were a little more... bold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15988"
msgid "Did you want something to eat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16012"
msgid "I'll have this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16024"
